# ODJ V7.6 staging configuration TEMPLATE ONLY — not a working environment file.
# On an isolated staging host, generate a private .env.staging interactively:
# python scripts/setup_staging.py --domain preview.your-actual-domain.com
# python scripts/check_staging.py
#
# The generated .env.staging contains APP_ENV=staging, PAYMENT_MODE=demo,
# unique staging PostgreSQL/session secrets, a separately hashed ADMIN password,
# a different site access username/password, and no payment/email credentials.
# Never commit the generated file or copy local .env / customer data to staging.
